ts including protein, creatine, amino acids, betaine and beta-alanine boost total nitrogen uptake and amplify the power of the formula. The more nitrogen a product has, the stronger it will perform, delivering maximum performance and results."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Consult a physician or licensed qualified health care professional before using this product, including, but not limited to, if you have, or have a family history of, prostate cancer, prostate enlargement, heart disease, low \"good\" cholesterol (HDL), or if you are using any other dietary supplement, prescription drug, or over-the-counter drug."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Servings Per Container    50     25"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"{chart}\nDose     Nitro-Factor(TM)    BCAA(mg)   Ergogenic Compound (mg)     Benefit\n1 scoop   3.5                           2500             2550                                   Fuels training, activates muscle protein synthesis and supports insulin biosynthesis*\n2 scoops    7                            5000             5100                                   Maximizes ergogenic response, amplifies strength, power and athletic performance.* Activates muscle protein synthesis and insulin biosynthesis*\n"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"EXPERIENCE BEYOND RAW(R) REBEL(TM)\nGNC Beyond RAW(R) is introducing its first ever hardcore, multi-phase ergogenic modulator. GNC Scientists have created this fully loaded pro-anabolic compound for extreme training results! This unique formula provides a scientifically-backed system to boost anabolic primers and provide fuel for hardcore effects.*"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"ANTI-CATABOLIC BLEND"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"With a powerful BCAA blend, this unique formula provides key amino acids to help preserv muscle glycogen stores and reduce muscle tissue breakdown.*"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"ANABOLIC PUMP MATRIX"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"GNC Nitro-Factor(TM) is a score that shows the full muscle building potential of a GNC product, beyond its protein content. Rebel(TM) is loaded with 7 grams of nitrogen-rich ingredients."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"^When used in conjunction with weight training."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Not intended for use by persons under 40."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"This product should not be used for more than 4 weeks continuously without the permission of a physician."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, consume daily. Mix 1 scoop with 8-10 oz. of water and consume before workouts and any time on non-training days. For maximum results, consume 2 scoops daily. Cycle this product for four weeks with two weeks off between usage."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Enhanced blood vessel dilation sets the stage for vital anabolic nutrients to be rushed to the muscle cells where muscle triggers are activated. This loaded matrix primes your body for extreme performance.*"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"EXTREME ERGOGENIC COMPOUND"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"WARNING: NOT FOR USE BY INDIVIDUALS UNDER THE AGE OF 18 YEARS."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"DO NOT USE IF PREGNANT OR NURSING."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not exceed recommended serving. Exceeding recommended serving may cause serious adverse health effects. Possible side effects include acne, hair loss, hair growth on the face (in women), aggressiveness, irritability, and increased levels of estrogen. Discontinue use and call a physician or licensed qualified health care professional immediately if you experience rapid heartbeat, dizziness, blurred vision, or other similar symptoms."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Serving Size: 1 scoop (7.1 g) 2 scoops (14.2 g)"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"To report any adverse event, call 1-800-332-1088."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 11987 4","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}